_entity_id":6289,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d43-db0e-11ef-90dc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"河西之战（后期）","tongjian_id":"war_N0507"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉亦置稒阳塞。后汉永元初，窦宪出鸡鹿塞，邓鸿出稒阳塞，皆...","context_before":"...战国时，魏地。《史记》：魏惠王十九年，筑长城，塞固阳。又","source_end_index":61,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a3df9f41-5e51-5523-90c1-362fa534150a","source_start_index":44,"source_text":"秦孝公十一年，卫鞅围魏固阳，降之。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十、榆林镇（卷六十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1秦衞鞅圍魏固陽，降之。","content_fanyi":"秦国卫鞅率兵围攻魏国固阳，迫使固阳投降。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦衞鞅围魏固阳，降之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":147,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d2a-db0e-11ef-8a05-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"五霸","people_name_jianti_auto":"五霸","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d47-db0e-11ef-9e4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":175,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d48-db0e-11ef-bfd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濁漳水","place_name_jianti_auto":"浊漳水","start_index":178,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d49-db0e-11ef-80c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党","start_index":182,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d4a-db0e-11ef-860d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長子縣鹿谷山","place_name_jianti_auto":"长子县鹿谷山","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d4b-db0e-11ef-8f35-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺","start_index":193,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d4c-db0e-11ef-a10a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清漳","place_name_jianti_auto":"清漳","start_index":196,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d4d-db0e-11ef-8e7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長子縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"长子县","start_index":204,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d4e-db0e-11ef-919b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"發鳩山","place_name_jianti_auto":"发鸠山","start_index":207,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d4f-db0e-11ef-ba7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武安縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武安县","start_index":213,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d50-db0e-11ef-beea-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清漳","place_name_jianti_auto":"清漳","start_index":217,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d51-db0e-11ef-82e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"交漳口","place_name_jianti_auto":"交漳口","start_index":223,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d52-db0e-11ef-87dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺县","start_index":230,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d53-db0e-11ef-b0ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"列人","place_name_jianti_auto":"列人","start_index":232,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d54-db0e-11ef-a46a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鉅鹿","place_name_jianti_auto":"巨鹿","start_index":239,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d55-db0e-11ef-a0a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信都","place_name_jianti_auto":"信都","start_index":241,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d56-db0e-11ef-8e62-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"衡漳","place_name_jianti_auto":"衡漳","start_index":246,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d57-db0e-11ef-83b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平舒縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平舒县","start_index":253,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d58-db0e-11ef-8529-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"記·曲禮曰：涖牲曰盟。盟者，殺牲歃血，誓於神也。天下太平之時，諸侯不得擅相與盟，惟天子巡狩至方岳之下，會畢，乃與諸侯相盟，同好惡，獎王室，以昭事神、訓民、事君，凡國有疑則盟，詛其不信者。至於五霸，有事而會，不協而盟。盟之爲法，先鑿地爲方坎，殺牲於坎上，割牲左耳，盛以珠盤；又取血，盛以玉敦；用血爲盟書，成，乃歃血而讀書。左傳云：「坎用牲加書，」是也。班志：濁漳水出上黨長子縣鹿谷山，東至鄴，入清漳。水經曰：出長子縣發鳩山，東至武安縣與清漳會，謂之交漳口。又東過鄴縣列人，又東北過鉅鹿信都，謂之衡漳；又東北過平舒縣南而東入海。漳，諸良翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"记·曲礼曰：涖牲曰盟。盟者，杀牲歃血，誓于神也。天下太平之时，诸侯不得擅相与盟，惟天子巡狩至方岳之下，会毕，乃与诸侯相盟，同好恶，奖王室，以昭事神、训民、事君，凡国有疑则盟，诅其不信者。至于五霸，有事而会，不协而盟。盟之为法，先凿地为方坎，杀牲于坎上，割牲左耳，盛以珠盘；又取血，盛以玉敦；用血为盟书，成，乃歃血而读书。左传云：「坎用牲加书，」是也。班志：浊漳水出上党长子县鹿谷山，东至邺，入清漳。水经曰：出长子县发鸠山，东至武安县与清漳会，谓之交漳口。又东过邺县列人，又东北过巨鹿信都，谓之衡漳；又东北过平舒县南而东入海。漳，诸良翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d46-db0e-11ef-995c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":1,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d5d-db0e-11ef-80d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d5e-db0e-11ef-8a15-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邯鄲","place_name_jianti_auto":"邯郸","resolved_place_entity_id":619,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d5f-db0e-11ef-aec2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d60-db0e-11ef-8a05-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漳水","place_name_jianti_auto":"漳水","place_note":"源出山西长子，流经河北邯郸东","resolved_place_entity_id":1135,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d61-db0e-11ef-9124-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"桂陵之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0509"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、唐虞 三代 春秋 战国 秦（卷一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"成侯，敬侯子也。若敬侯已都邯郸，安有魏克其国都而不亡者？...","context_before":"...书纪年》：周安王十六年，赵敬侯自晋阳徙都邯郸。胡三省曰：","source_end_index":173,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2e4a9e78-d37b-5819-8b96-22eb67c47568","source_start_index":151,"source_text":"成侯二十二年，魏克邯郸。三十四年，魏归邯郸。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/一、唐虞 三代 春秋 战国 秦（卷一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、广平府（卷十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"说者曰：是时赵未都邯郸也，至肃侯时始都之，《竹书》误改为...","context_before":"...，军于邯郸之东。《竹书》：周安王十六年，赵敬侯始都邯郸。","source_end_index":197,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"236224b6-7d08-5b13-ac0a-7269d9e6f042","source_start_index":148,"source_text":"《史记》：赵成侯二十一年，魏围我邯郸。二十二年，魏惠王拔我邯郸。二十四年，魏归我邯郸，与盟漳水上。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/六、广平府（卷十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、彰德府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《水经注》：后汉建安十八年，曹公凿渠引漳水东入清洹以通河...","context_before":"...林县东流经此，又东北接临漳县界，清漳水流合焉。《史记》：","source_end_index":61,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"610da6d7-a9a4-52d8-8606-d07d077e29a9","source_start_index":39,"source_text":"赵成侯二十四年，魏归我邯郸，与魏盟于漳水上。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/五、彰德府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"2魏人歸趙邯鄲。與趙盟漳水上。","content_fanyi":"魏国人把所占领的邯郸归还给赵国，并与赵国在漳水边盟誓。","content_jianti_auto":"2魏人归赵邯郸。与赵盟漳水上。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":148,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d44-db0e-11ef-a192-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"四岳","people_name_jianti_auto":"四岳","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd337-db0e-11ef-94d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"申伯","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd338-db0e-11ef-ac20-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"申侯","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd339-db0e-11ef-b408-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申鮮虞","people_name_jianti_auto":"申鲜虞","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd33a-db0e-11ef-a728-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"申","place_name_jianti_auto":"申","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd33b-db0e-11ef-a00b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd33c-db0e-11ef-bf8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd33d-db0e-11ef-aee2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd33e-db0e-11ef-ad04-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：昭德有勞曰昭；聖聞周達曰昭。姓譜：四岳之後封於申。周有申伯，鄭有大夫申侯，齊有申鮮虞。相，息亮翻。","not